{"id": "67828", "title": "冷少的七日恋人", "author": "黑爱丽丝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/67/67828.htm", "intro": "“过来，吻我。”“是。”话音刚落，她的衣衫一扯而尽，陶瓷娃娃般精美的脸上却毫无表情，俯身熟练地吻着他的唇，辗转**。她是他从夜市买回来的“特殊宠物”。她无心无情，只是他的玩具。他邪肆地吻着她，阴冷的气息喷洒在她的脸庞。一年后，她淡淡道：“我有了你的孩子。”他抬起她的下巴，冷笑道：“打掉……”紧紧绑住她，寻鱼水之欢，不过，是场无爱的欢。", "base": "files/article/html/67/67828", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10478714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10478716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10478717.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10478718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10478720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10478721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10478723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10478724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10478726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10478728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10478729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10478732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10478735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "10478738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "10478741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "10478744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "10478758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "10478762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "10478765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "10478768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "10478771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "10478775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "10478779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "10478781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10478784.html", "available": false}]}